## F155: The controlled vocabularies, as SKOS and SHACL  (Matt, 2026-08-28)
## =============================================================================
## "We need to work on defined with SKOS and SHACL then. Lets look at our
## features, and align them with those standards or others. We want a strong
## foundation, and a place to look for refinement (W3C)."

kb:controlled-vocabularies rdf:type ktype:Feature ;
               kpred:tested-by    "src/lib/rdf/__tests__/vocabulary-ttl.test.ts" ;
               rdfs:label   "Closed vocabularies as SKOS schemes, enforced by lint" ;
